{
  "schemaVersion": "lekalo/adapter-sdk-inputs/v0.8.0",
  "identity": "dev.lekalo.adapter-sdk-inputs@0.8.0",
  "description": "Reviewed generator configuration (issue #106): the ordered local inputs the SDK generator consumes, the exact per-version operation vocabulary, the package identities, the toolchain pins, and the semantic-coverage obligations. Digests are computed by the generator over exact file bytes at run time and recorded in the emitted generation records; this file pins order and roles, not bytes.",
